    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d624">

                <pb facs="0776" n="668" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg668"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Porter to Mr.
                            Blaine</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Rome</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1891-03-16"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">March 16, 1891</hi>.</date> (Received March
                        30.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 175.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Yesterday I sent you the following telegram
                    in cipher.<anchor n="*" xml:id="d624-f1"/></p>
                <p>Although convinced that every possible measure was being taken by our Government
                    for the protection of Italians, I forwarded the above at the earnest request of
                    the under secretary of foreign affairs, who called upon me immediately after the
                    news of this lamentable affair reached Rome and urged that some such
                    representation should be made.</p>
                <p>This morning I called upon Minister di Rudini, minister of foreign affairs, and
                    expressed to him my horror at the assassinations and the conviction that the
                    President and the people of the United States would deeply lament the same and
                    were taking energetic measures for the protection of Italians.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">A. G. Porter</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d624-f1" n="*" xml:id="d624-f1-content">
                <p>For telegram see telegram from Mr. Whitehouse of March 15.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
